msgstr "Item hau beste item batzuk fabrikatzeko erabiltzen da batez ere."

#: mods/HELP/doc_items/init.lua:13
msgid "Hold it in your hand, then leftclick to eat it."
msgstr "Heldu eskuan eta gero egin ezker-klik jateko."

#: mods/HELP/doc_items/init.lua:14
msgid ""
"Hold it in your hand, then leftclick to eat it. But why would you want to do "
"this?"
msgstr ""
"Eutsi eskuan eta gero egin ezker-klik jateko. Baina zergatik egingo zenuke "
"hau?"

#: mods/HELP/doc_items/init.lua:15
msgid ""
"This block's rotation is affected by the way you place it: Place it on the "
"floor or ceiling for a vertical orientation; place it at the side for a "
"horizontal orientation. Sneaking while placing it leads to a perpendicular "
"orientation instead."
msgstr ""
"Bloke hau jartzen duzun moduak bere errotazioari eragiten dio: Jarri lurrean "
"edo sabaian orientazio bertikal baterako; jarri albo batean orientazio "
"horizontal baterako. Makurtu jartzen duzun bitartean, orientazio "
"perpendikularra ematen du."

