#: mods/HELP/doc_items/init.lua:1279
msgid ""
"Whenever you are not wielding any item, you use the hand which acts as a "
"tool with its own capabilities. When you are wielding an item which is not a "
"mining tool or a weapon it will behave as if it would be the hand."
msgstr ""
"Ez bazara item bat eusten ari, erabili eskua berezko gaitasunak dituen "
"tresna gisa. Ustiatzekoa ez den tresna edo arma bat eusten ari bazara, eskua "
"balitz bezala jokatuko du."
